{"kind":"html","caption":"使用荷兰国旗三指针：left 之前都是 0，right 之后都是 2，scan 负责检查尚未分类的元素。遇到 0 就与 left 交换并同时右移 left、scan；遇到 1 只右移 scan；遇到 2 则与 right 交换并左移 right，scan 留在原位继续检查换回来的数。示例经过一趟扫描原地变为 [0,0,1,1,2,2]，额外空间为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>颜色分类可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.chip{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,38px);gap:4px;margin:6px 0}\n.array .cell{min-height:48px;width:38px}\n.array .cell .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;display:block}\n.array .cell .pointers{font-size:10px;color:#3794ff;min-height:12px}\n.cell.target{background:#173d5c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.zones{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.4}\n.zone{padding:6px 8px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}\n.bar{display:block;height:3px;background:#3794ff;border-radius:2px;transition:width .35s}\n.rule{margin:0;padding-left:16px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>荷兰国旗三指针</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">一趟扫描原地分为 0 / 1 / 2 三段。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"chip\"><span class=\"mono\">0</span> 红</span><span class=\"chip\"><span class=\"mono\">1</span> 白</span><span class=\"chip\"><span class=\"mono\">2</span> 蓝</span></div>\n<div id=\"array\" class=\"array\" aria-label=\"数组状态\"></div>\n<div class=\"zones\">\n<div class=\"zone\"><strong class=\"accent\">[0,left)</strong> 已归位 0</div>\n<div class=\"zone\"><strong class=\"accent\">[left,scan)</strong> 已归位 1</div>\n<div class=\"zone\"><strong class=\"accent\">[scan,right]</strong> 未分类</div>\n<div class=\"zone\"><strong class=\"accent\">(right,n)</strong> 已归位 2</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;margin-top:6px;border-radius:2px\"><span id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n<ol class=\"rule panel\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><li>0：与 left 交换，left++、scan++</li><li>1：scan++</li><li>2：与 right 交换，right--</li></ol>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst frames = [\n  {a:[2,0,2,1,1,0], l:0, s:0, r:5, hi:[0], to:[5], text:'初始化：三个指针覆盖整个未分类区间。'},\n  {a:[0,0,2,1,1,2], l:0, s:0, r:4, hi:[0], to:[5], text:'scan 看到 2：与 right 处的 0 交换，right 左移；scan 不动。'},\n  {a:[0,0,2,1,1,2], l:1, s:1, r:4, hi:[0], to:[], text:'scan 现在看到换回来的 0：它已在 left 位置，left 与 scan 同时右移。'},\n  {a:[0,0,2,1,1,2], l:2, s:2, r:4, hi:[1], to:[1], text:'再次看到 0：与 left 位置交换（此处数值相同），left 与 scan 同时右移。'},\n  {a:[0,0,1,1,2,2], l:2, s:2, r:3, hi:[2], to:[4], text:'scan 看到 2：与 right 处的 1 交换，right 左移；继续检查当前位置。'},\n  {a:[0,0,1,1,2,2], l:2, s:3, r:3, hi:[2], to:[], text:'scan 看到 1：它属于中间区域，只将 scan 右移。'},\n  {a:[0,0,1,1,2,2], l:2, s:4, r:3, hi:[3], to:[], text:'scan 再次看到 1：继续右移。此时 scan > right，分类完成。'},\n  {a:[0,0,1,1,2,2], l:2, s:4, r:3, hi:[], to:[], text:'完成：0、1、2 三段有序；全程只使用三个指针。'}\n];\nconst arrayEl = document.getElementById('array');\nconst statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\nconst barEl = document.getElementById('bar');\nlet step = 0;\n\nfunction render(f) {\n  arrayEl.innerHTML = '';\n  f.a.forEach((value, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell' + (f.hi.includes(i) ? ' active' : '') + (f.to.includes(i) ? ' target' : '');\n    const names = [];\n    if (i === f.l) names.push('left');\n    if (i === f.s) names.push('scan');\n    if (i === f.r) names.push('right');\n    cell.innerHTML = '<span class=\"index\">下标 ' + i + '</span><span class=\"value\">' + value + '</span><div class=\"pointers\">' + (names.length ? names.join(' · ') : '　') + '</div>';\n    arrayEl.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n  statusEl.innerHTML = '<strong>步骤 ' + (step + 1) + ' / ' + frames.length + '</strong><br>' + f.text;\n  barEl.style.width = ((step + 1) / frames.length * 100) + '%';\n}\n\nrender(frames[step]);\nsetInterval(() => {\n  step = (step + 1) % frames.length;\n  render(frames[step]);\n}, 2200);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
